{"id":"655194","name":"肉松雪花酥","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/655194/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"棉花糖","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"日式小圆饼","amount":"200g"},{"name":"肉松","amount":"100g（留一部分抹面）"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料提前称重准备好。","img":"images/655194/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄油提前解冻备用。","img":"images/655194/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅放入黄油炒融化。","img":"images/655194/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入棉花糖。","img":"images/655194/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小火把棉花糖炒配件（锅有些小了中途换一个）。","img":"images/655194/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入奶粉快速翻炒。","img":"images/655194/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入肉松。","img":"images/655194/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入小圆饼干。","img":"images/655194/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"关火快速翻炒均匀。","img":"images/655194/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒匀后倒入烤盘中。","img":"images/655194/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将炒好的雪花酥整一下形。","img":"images/655194/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"整理好后上面再均匀的铺上一层肉松。","img":"images/655194/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"全部整理好后放凉。","img":"images/655194/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"晾凉后的雪花酥就可以开切了。","img":"images/655194/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"改刀切小块就可以享用了。","img":"images/655194/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/655194/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/655194/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/655194/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}